fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Target|Area|size=42px}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|broodmother_spiders_milk}}
** Grants the following units the {{M|lifesteal}}-based heal buff centered around the {{M|Death|text=dying}} unit:
*** Broodmother
*** Broodmother's {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.
*** {{U|Spiderling|text=Spiderlings}}
** Reapplying the buff creates an independent instance, with each buff duration independent of the other.
** Applies a <!--{{calc|v1*{{#var:Spider's Milk basic1}}|v1={{#var:Spider's Milk value2}}|%}}--> {{M|lifesteal}}-based heal in {{#var:Spider's Milk basic1}}-second intervals, over {{#expr:{{#var:Spider's Milk value3}}/{{#var:Spider's Milk basic1}}}} heal instances.
** {{Symbol|Deny}}
*** Only [[denies]] sourced to Broodmother will proc the heal component within the radius.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spider's Milk icon0}}
| desc = Whenever Broodmother kills a unit, she and all units under her control in a 600 radius receive a buff for 3s that heals them for a percentage of the victim's health every 0.5 seconds. Healing from creeps is reduced by 40%.
}}

