{{Morphnotes
| name = Spin Web
| desc = All created {{U|Spin Web|text=Spin Webs}} immediately diasppear upon losing ability.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Spin Web
| desc = All created {{U|Spin Web|text=Spin Webs}} immediately diasppear upon losing ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spin Web icon0}}
| desc = Spins a large web that grants Broodmother a passive movement speed increase and increases her Turn Rate, while in its vicinity, as well as giving free movement.<br><br>Spin Web can be cast from anywhere as long as the new web touches an existing web. Webs never expire, and can be manually destroyed. When the maximum limit of webs is exceeded, the oldest web disappears.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Has {{#expr:{{Show|H|Broodmother|turnrate}}+{{#var:Spin Web value3}}}}-{{M|turn rate}}.
** All affected {{U|Spiderling|text=Spiderlings}} now have {{#expr:{{Show|U|Spiderling|turn rate}}+{{#var:Spin Web value3}}}}-turn rate.

* The {{U|Spin Web}} has the following additional unit properties:
** {{M|Attack immune}}
** {{M|Disarm}}
** {{M|Spell immune}}

