}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spinner's Snare icon0}}
| desc = Broodmother may create up to 5 invisible web lines touching any existing web. Enemy Heroes that cross the web line will spring the trap, becoming rooted, revealed in fog, and take damage over time.  Multiple Heroes can trip on the same line until it's destroyed after being initially triggered.  Broodmother's team is alerted via the minimap when an enemy has triggered the snare.
}}
* Has the following additional unit ({{Code|npc_dota_thinker}}) properties:
** Has {{M|invisible|text=permanent invisibility}} and {{M|phase movement}}.
** {{M|Unselectable}}
** Neither grants {{M|vision}} and are not visible through the {{M|Fog of War}}.

* Deals a max {{#expr:{{#var:Spinner's Snare type1 value1}}*({{#var:Spinner's Snare type1 value5}} round0)}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) over the entire duration.

